      "filename": "Bediasites (35 Ma, Late Eocene; southeastern Texas) (14794094774).jpg",
      "title": "File:Bediasites (35 Ma, Late Eocene; southeastern Texas) (14794094774).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/37/Bediasites_%2835_Ma%2C_Late_Eocene%3B_southeastern_Texas%29_%2814794094774%29.jpg",
